            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nyu 18:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man mange, malaika mir arionde, m’ulubo ng’eye, ewacu kumae, Babeli ma dit, upodho, upodho m’eketho thek ceke gimadhu pigulok mi kwinyo mi tarwang’ pare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man malaika mange, mir adege, ulubo ng’eigi, m’ewacu ku dwal ma dit kumae, Tek ng’atu moko rwo ni yedi kud ayine de, man ejolo kiedo ternyime kadi i cinge, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.51.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 51:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.19.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tha 19:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.38.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eze 38:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "en bende ebimadhu kum pigulok mi kwinyo pa Mungu, m’ubedo ayika m’ajeba ngo i kikombe mi ng’ecwiny pare; man jubimie ndiba ma ku mac man muganga i wang’ malaika maleng’, man i wang’ Nyathi Rombo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.34.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 34:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man yiro mi ndiba migi idho malu rondo ku rondo; man yom umbe igi dieceng’ ku diewor, gi ju m’urwo ni yedi kud ayine de, ku ju m’ujolo kiedo mi nyinge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keni en e twiocwiny mi jumaleng’, gi ju ma giworo lembang’ola pa Mungu, ku yioyic pa Yesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
